    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n43835" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Serdica</span></b> , ae, f., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a city of
				Mœsia</i>, <i><span class="en">Cassiod. Hist.
				Eccl. 4, 21</span></i>.—Hence, </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Ser-dicensis</span></b> , e,
				adj., <i>Serdican</i>, <i>of Serdica</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">concilium,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cassiod. Hist. Eccl. 4, 24</span></i>
			.—</div>
